{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know that MMO where you can do absolutely anything? This is it. <strong>Defecate</strong> in someone else\u2019s apartment, die from a <strong>Meowghurt\u00a0</strong>overdose, or throw a <strong>rave</strong> \u2014 everything\u2019s allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than a game, <strong>Bl\u00eaktre 2081</strong> is an online life simulator set in a single, persistent city \u2014 a grotesque cyberpunk dystopia where controlled chaos reigns, somewhere between <i>South Park</i> and retro adventure games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone fights for their share of the city, fueled by a circular economy based on corpses recycled into sausages, with rules self-managed by the players themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A telling example: the player-president can decide whether undocumented players (demo users) can roam freely, or allow the player-cops to arrest them instead. In short: <strong>players can even decide whether the game is free.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental, punchline-packed, and socially charged.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Run The Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3045400/6abac9f7bce53d7e66b1c7a6b40987bfa6967606.jpg"},{"name":"Acid Test","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3045400/7b71e6e66a378a9f0afc675e536fba4427c06d83.jpg"},{"name":"Alcoholic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3045400/a6b944de1037b46fd4f63423dd79c85c71df937d.jpg"},{"name":"Immortal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3045400/9518d6659fc4753a6165968d61bd650771ff911d.jpg"},{"name":"Scato-Terrorism","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3045400/7